          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Thou",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "art",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.6.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.6.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "beautiful, O my love, as Tirzah, comely as Jerusalem, terrible as",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "an army",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.6.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.6.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "with banners.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Turn away thine eyes from me, for they have overcome me: thy hair",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.6.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.6.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "as a flock of goats that appear from Gilead.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thy teeth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.6.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.6.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "as a flock of sheep which go up from the washing, whereof every one beareth twins, and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.6.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.6.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not one barren among them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As a piece of a pomegranate",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.6.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.6.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thy temples within thy locks.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "There are threescore queens, and fourscore concubines, and virgins without number.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "My dove, my undefiled is",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "but",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.6.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.6.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "one; she",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.6.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.6.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "only",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.6.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.6.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "one of her mother, she",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.6.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.6.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the choice",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "one",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.6.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.6.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of her that bare her. The daughters saw her, and blessed her;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "yea",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.6.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.6.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", the queens and the concubines, and they praised her.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.6.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
