          "text": "she",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.6.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.6.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "looketh forth as the morning, fair as the moon, clear as the sun,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.6.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.6.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "terrible as",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "an army",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.6.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.6.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "with banners?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.6.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I went down into the garden of nuts to see the fruits of the valley,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.6.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.6.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to see whether the vine flourished,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.6.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.6.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the pomegranates budded.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Or ever I was aware, my soul made me",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "like",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.6.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.6.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the chariots of Amminadib.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Return, return, O Shulamite; return, return, that we may look upon thee. What will ye see in the Shulamite? As it were the company of two armies.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.7.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
